OL,3,ATrump rallies for Republicans as
OL,4,ADemocrats make closing arguments on eve
OL,5,Aof US midterm elections
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the final day of campaigning in
OL,8,Fthe US midterms, where key elections
OL,9,Fwill determine which party controls
OL,10,FCongress for the rest of Donald Trump's
OL,11,Fpresidency - see how these elections
OL,12,Fcould reshape US politics
OL,14,FEarlier, Democrat Haley Stevens stunned
OL,15,Fher party after endorsing Republican
OL,16,Fcandidate Mike Rogers - Abdul
OL,17,FEl-Sayed's rival in the tight Michigan
OL,18,FSenate race
